==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[elative]] [[case]]|-}}

# {{grammar}} The [[case]] used to indicate movement '''out of''' something; for example, ''out of the house''. Some languages that make use of the elative are [[Finnish]], [[Hungarian]], and [[Estonian]].

